OL,3,AAbout 280 people evacuated after fire
OL,4,Aat seaside hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FFolkestone and Hythe District Council
OL,7,Fhas set up a welfare centre at the
OL,8,FThree Hills Sports Park and nearby
OL,9,Fresidents have been advised to avoid
OL,10,Fthe area of the fire and close windows
OL,11,Fand doors.
